                            "Internet"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "16353543-8927-39ad-9b43-a1addb419e2a",
                        "entry_id": "55ef1a24-8b99-365b-8958-225370c0683e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The operator of a flat joint, or crooked gambling operation."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "af5c7891-fe04-4c6d-9eb9-a7122cbd611e",
                                "sense_id": "16353543-8927-39ad-9b43-a1addb419e2a",
                                "text": "A carnival hawker may run a legitimate game in which you have a fair chance to win, but then again he may be a flattie — a carnival grifter expert at separating the unwary from their money."
